---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base
	title="Privacy Policy | Apartment Wealth Navigator"
	description="How Apartment Wealth Navigator collects, uses, and stores information from site visitors and form submissions."
	canonical="https://apartmentwealthnavigator.com/privacy/"
>
	<article class="legal">
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="legal__updated">Last updated September 12, 2026.</p>

		<p>
			This policy explains what information Apartment Wealth Navigator collects when you visit
			this site or submit a form, and how that information is used.
		</p>

		<h2>What we collect</h2>
		<p>
			When you submit the NOI Quick Check tool, the get-started form, or the contact form, we
			collect your name, email, phone number, and the building location or address you enter.
			We also collect any building details you choose to enter into the NOI Quick Check tool,
			such as unit count, rent, and expenses.
		</p>

		<h2>How we use it</h2>
		<p>
			We use this information to respond to your inquiry, to contact you about your building and
			your questions, and to send you relevant follow-up by phone, text, or email. Form
			submissions are sent to our customer relationship management system, GoHighLevel, where
			Shafiq Hirani and his team can follow up.
		</p>

		<h2>What we do not do</h2>
		<p>
			We do not sell your personal information. We do not store payment information on this site,
			because this site does not process payments.
		</p>

		<h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
		<p>
			This site may use analytics cookies to understand traffic, shown to you through a consent
			banner. Analytics only load after you accept. You can decline, and you can change your
			choice at any time by clearing your browser's local storage for this site.
		</p>

		<h2>Your choices</h2>
		<p>
			You can ask us to delete the information you submitted by contacting us at the email or
			phone number on the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>. Reply STOP to any text message to
			opt out of further texts.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>
			Questions about this policy go to Shafiq Hirani through the <a href="/contact">Contact
			page</a>.
		</p>
	</article>
</Base>

<style>
	.legal {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4);
	}

	.legal__updated {
		color: var(--color-slate);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
	}
</style>
